@startuml
title Observation Unit Sequence - Observation Activity & Record Provenance
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Step Composition" as SC
participant "SPU Observation Unit (SPUObU)" as OU
participant "Observation Target Scope" as TS
participant "Observation Record" as OR

SC -> OU : associate with target scope
OU -> TS : observe(call, callback, sampling, subscription)
TS --> OU : observation activity
OU --> OR : produce Observation Record
(stepInstanceIdentity, observationUnitIdentity,
observationUnitAssociationIdentity,
associationTargetIdentity,
observationInvocationIdentity,
observationRecordIdentity)
OR --> SC : observation record (outside StepExecutionResult)

note right of SC : Observation Records remain independent of StepExecutionResult
Preserve provenance/custody
Association establishes applicability only
Does not guarantee active observation

@enduml